{#- Choose the day (Starter): a delivery date for later, checked in the browser against the florist's own delivery
    days, cut-offs, closed dates and bank holidays; only a day they deliver goes on the order. Needs JavaScript. -#}
<div class="fl-when" data-feature="deliver-on" data-js-only>
  <label class="fl-when-l" for="week-when">For another day? <span>Choose when it arrives</span></label>
  <input id="week-when" type="date" data-when-input>
  <p class="fl-when-say" data-when-say aria-live="polite"></p>
</div>
